      "releaseNotes": "New:\n- RAW as TIFF — save your RAW shots as a flat 16-bit TIFF instead of DNG, a neutral base for color grading in desktop editors\n\nImprovements:\n- More reliable look editing in the gallery\n- Improved stability and memory handling",
      "version": "5.1.0",
