      "currency": "EUR",
      "description": "IIWII is a minimalist camera app that brings the beauty of analog film photography to your iPhone.\n\nIT IS WHAT IT IS — No complicated settings, no endless menus. Just point, shoot, and capture authentic moments with stunning film-inspired looks applied in real-time.\n\nTIMELESS FILM LOOKS\n• Carefully crafted presets inspired by classic film stocks\n• Real-time preview — what you see is what you get\n• Adjustable intensity for your perfect look\n• Import your own .cube LUT files as custom looks\n• Look Manager — create and fine-tune your looks with tone curves, color mixing, white balance and more\n• Natural Processing — less computational overprocessing, more authentic camera feel\n\nFULL MANUAL CONTROL\n• White Balance, Shutter Speed, ISO and Focus\n• Each parameter toggleable between Auto and Manual\n• Swipe down to reveal, swipe up to hide\n\nTHOUGHTFUL FEATURES\n• RAW+ Capture on all iPhones — save DNG files alongside your photo\n• Portrait mode with natural depth-of-field blur\n• Double Exposure — blend two shots into one, just like real film\n• Self-Timer with 2, 5 or 10 second countdown\n• Record video with real-time film looks applied\n• Grid overlays and horizon level for composition\n• Built-in gallery with sharing and favorites\n• QR Code detection\n\nDESIGNED FOR SIMPLICITY\n• Clean, distraction-free interface\n• Ambient light effect reacts to your camera feed (iOS 26)\n• Quick preset switching with swipe gestures\n• Double-tap to flip camera\n• Edge exposure slider for precise control\n• Customizable top bar — choose your controls\n• Lock Screen camera with shared settings and looks\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\n• GPS tagging is optional and controllable\n• Location data automatically removed when sharing (configurable)\n• No analytics, no tracking, no ads — ever\n\nIIWII respects your moments. No cloud uploads, no accounts, no subscriptions. Your photos stay on your device.\n\nCapture what matters. It is what it is.",
